ur RATP.<\/p>","shortMessage":"Autre","disruption_id":"1ec2f52c-ca8c-4efa-a0a7-fd3e25d75ed2"},{"id":"05d5bab4-0868-44d9-8841-ce294b3e18a9","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260930T033000","end":"20270101T023000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260930T004850","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","title":"RER D : allègement de l’offre de transport","message":"<p>L&#8217;offre de transport du RER D est r&#233;duite pendant plusieurs mois.<br><br><br>Pour pr&#233;parer votre trajet et avant de vous rendre en gare, v&#233;rifiez les horaires des trains qui circulent en vous rendant dans la rubrique recherche d&#8217;itin&#233;raire de votre application.<br><br><br>Attention : les horaires du calculateur d&#8217;itin&#233;raire tiennent compte de ces modifications &#224; partir de J-15 avant votre date de voyage.<br><br><br>Retrouvez plus d&#8217;informations sur le blog du RER D :<br><a href=\"https:\/\/maligned.transilien.com\/2026\/08\/21\/reduction-de-loffre-rer-d-24-aout\/\">https:\/\/maligned.transilien.com\/2026\/08\/21\/reduction-de-loffre-rer-d-24-aout\/<\/a><br><br><br>Motif : capacit&#233; de maintenance des trains temporairement r&#233;duite (cr&#233;ation de nouveaux ateliers de maintenance)<\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic perturbé","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01728","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:411422","name":"Orry-la-Ville - Coye (Orry-la-Ville)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:60309","name":"Corbeil-Essonnes (Corbeil-Essonnes)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01728","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:66535","name":"Goussainville (Goussainville)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:61926","name":"Melun (Melun)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01728","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:60309","name":"Corbeil-Essonnes (Corbeil-Essonnes)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:411422","name":"Orry-la-Ville - Coye (Orry-la-Ville)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01728","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"